  "releaseNotes": "Adds .NET 9 and .NET 10 targets and AddEfCoreRepository for per-scope DbContext registration. Fixes: BeginTransactionAsync honours the isolation level; Any(out entity) no longer fails or disposes the context; the DatabaseOptions unit of work saves changes; updates of entities with string keys; assembly-scan registration registers IBaseReadRepository and skips abstract types. Raises dependency floors to versions without known security advisories.",
